# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the native tests (ASan builds). Only leaks
# that happen inside system libraries belong here, each with the reason.

# libvorbisenc leaks 2848 bytes per vorbis_encode_init_vbr() with more than
# two channels, even when followed by vorbis_info_clear() (reproduced with a
# minimal program against Ubuntu 24.04's libvorbis 1.3.7).
leak:vorbis_encode_setup_init

# Libraries FFmpeg pulls in (libaom, librsvg, libvdpau) leak while they
# initialize during dlopen.
leak:_dl_catch_exception
